1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fifth Episode
The Monsters of the Three Vallies

15
00:02:14,581 --> 00:02:16,617
Are you saying this rose is poisonous?

16
00:02:16,821 --> 00:02:20,018
Yes, indeed. My wife pricked her finger on a thorn...

17
00:02:20,061 --> 00:02:23,895
...and then she danced for three days until she died from it. Poor little wife!

18
00:02:26,261 --> 00:02:28,411
And how is it there are two coffins?

19
00:02:28,701 --> 00:02:31,010
Sir, my son is in the other.

20
00:02:31,061 --> 00:02:33,336
The only antidote to the rose's poison...

21
00:02:33,381 --> 00:02:35,258
...is an herb found in the Three Valleys...

22
00:02:35,301 --> 00:02:38,134
...and my son had gone right down there to look for this herb!

23
00:02:38,461 --> 00:02:40,497
He had the courage to go there?!

24
00:02:40,541 --> 00:02:42,816
I heard that there are monsters in the Three Valleys!

25
00:02:42,861 --> 00:02:46,410
Yes, he was surprised by one of them at the entrance to the first valley.

26
00:02:46,461 --> 00:02:48,417
The monster wounded him and then...

27
00:03:01,101 --> 00:03:04,696
Sapphire!
Don't you know that roses have thorns?

28
00:03:04,741 --> 00:03:06,618
Be careful!

29
00:03:07,661 --> 00:03:09,697
Good morning, mother!
I picked it for you!

30
00:03:09,741 --> 00:03:13,620
Every morning you give me a rose. How sweet you are!

31
00:03:13,661 --> 00:03:16,459
I will give you one every morning until your birthday!

32
00:03:16,501 --> 00:03:18,457
What color do you want tomorrow?

33
00:03:18,501 --> 00:03:21,174
- I would like a red rose.
- I will bring it to you!

34
00:03:21,421 --> 00:03:25,016
- Be careful!
- Don't worry, mom!

35
00:03:26,461 --> 00:03:28,417
It's adorable!

36
00:03:33,941 --> 00:03:35,818
A red rose, huh?

37
00:04:01,061 --> 00:04:03,700
No one in sight! Good!

38
00:04:04,021 --> 00:04:06,216
Let's get rid of all the red roses!

39
00:04:08,021 --> 00:04:09,739
And now...

40
00:04:10,021 --> 00:04:13,570
And now... I will leave in the rose
garden only this one, in plain sight!

41
00:04:13,621 --> 00:04:16,135
It's the only one and
Sapphire cannot help but pick it.

42
00:04:16,181 --> 00:04:18,172
But this one is poisoned..
.

43
00:04:34,301 --> 00:04:38,294
What a beautiful morning! I will go
immediately to pick a rose for my mother!

44
00:04:48,221 --> 00:04:50,018
Hooray!

45
00:04:53,661 --> 00:04:56,221
- Look at that squirrel!
- Let's play a trick on it!

46
00:05:06,021 --> 00:05:08,012
Now I'll show you!

47
00:05:14,181 --> 00:05:16,012
Look! Sapphire is down there!

48
00:05:25,421 --> 00:05:28,379
These are the last moments of
happiness for you, Prince Sapphire!

49
00:05:28,421 --> 00:05:31,219
You will die as soon as you
touch a thorn of the red rose!

50
00:05:32,701 --> 00:05:35,579
- What a magnificent rose!
- No, wait!

51
00:05:35,941 --> 00:05:38,250
Don't touch it!
Don't pick it, Prince!

52
00:05:39,021 --> 00:05:41,251
How cute!
Aren't you tired?

53
00:05:45,821 --> 00:05:48,130
Don't fly away! Wait!

54
00:05:48,381 --> 00:05:51,737
Wait, please!
Let's play together!

55
00:05:52,101 --> 00:05:54,661
Please, little birds! Listen to me!

56
00:05:54,701 --> 00:05:57,135
This morning I want to
pick it myself for Sapphire.

57
00:05:57,541 --> 00:05:59,896
What?! Stop! No!

58
00:05:59,941 --> 00:06:02,899
What is wrong, Baron Neelon,
that you look at me this way?

59
00:06:05,341 --> 00:06:07,013
How are you, Queen?

60
00:06:07,461 --> 00:06:10,612
A strange energy
compels me to dance!

61
00:06:10,661 --> 00:06:14,051
Good heavens! Sapphire was supposed to prick
herself and the Queen pricked herself instead!

62
00:06:14,100 --> 00:06:17,332
What will happen now? That poison
takes effect immediately and is deadly!

63
00:06:20,020 --> 00:06:23,138
Help me stop!
Please!

64
00:06:23,180 --> 00:06:25,615
I beg you, do something!

65
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:29,017
I can't stop anymore! Help!

66
00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:32,292
- What is the matter?
- My feet are dragging me!

67
00:06:32,340 --> 00:06:34,571
I understand: she pricked
herself with a poisonous flower!

68
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:37,418
What a tragedy!

69
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:40,696
Mother! Tell me, what is wrong with you?

70
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:44,574
Damn it! I didn't expect it
to be the Queen herself...

71
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:46,691
...to prick herself
with that poisonous rose!

72
00:06:46,740 --> 00:06:48,732
What are you saying?
She will only live for three days?!

73
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:51,011
Yes, Prince.
We are dismayed.

74
00:06:51,060 --> 00:06:54,497
- Her fever is too high.
- It will take her straight to the grave.

75
00:06:54,540 --> 00:06:56,497
Courtiers!

76
00:06:57,460 --> 00:06:59,452
- Help!
- Mother!

77
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:02,898
Alas!

78
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:05,572
Is there a medicine to cure her?

79
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:09,011
The only remedy is to put
a specific herb on the wounds.

80
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:12,258
Quick, go gather
this herb and bring it here!

81
00:07:12,460 --> 00:07:15,578
I am sorry, Prince, but the herb
grows in the Three Valleys...

82
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:17,896
...and whoever went down there
has never returned.

83
00:07:18,180 --> 00:07:21,571
It wouldn't happen to be that place where rumors
say some monsters live?

84
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:23,373
Exactly, that's the one!

85
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:25,616
I will order someone
to go there immediately!

86
00:07:28,700 --> 00:07:31,215
- I order you to go there!
- But I'm afraid!

87
00:07:31,260 --> 00:07:33,729
Coward! Are you afraid of monsters?
Then, you go!

88
00:07:33,780 --> 00:07:36,011
You know, Prince,
my wife is sick.

89
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:38,575
- And you? - I have children!
If I die, what will become of them?

90
00:07:38,620 --> 00:07:41,010
- You!
- I don't feel very well.

91
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:43,889
Cowards! Alright,
then I will go myself!

92
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:46,650
Magnificent! I still get
what I was hoping for!

93
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:49,169
If Sapphire goes down there, she
will be devoured by the monsters!

94
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:53,294
We cannot allow anything to
happen to the Crown Prince!

95
00:07:53,460 --> 00:07:56,339
- I will go!
- Wait, Your Highness!

96
00:07:56,460 --> 00:07:58,816
Let a faithful
General of yours...

97
00:07:58,860 --> 00:08:01,091
...go there at
the risk of his life!

98
00:08:01,380 --> 00:08:06,011
Today's young soldiers
are nothing but weaklings!

99
00:08:13,020 --> 00:08:15,012
I am forced to go myself!

100
00:08:15,060 --> 00:08:17,052
- Sapphire!
- May heaven protect you!

101
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:30,217
Sapphire! Is it true that the Queen
pricked herself with a poisonous rose?

102
00:08:30,260 --> 00:08:33,014
Yes! And now I'm going to the Three Valleys
to pick the herb that will cure her!

103
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:36,013
Sapphire, wait!

104
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:42,089
What? Sapphire went alone?!
But it's dangerous!

105
00:08:42,140 --> 00:08:44,894
Neelon, immediately send
some soldiers to help him...

106
00:08:44,941 --> 00:08:48,217
...and choose the strongest!
- Yes, yes, Sire!

107
00:08:50,421 --> 00:08:53,219
Instead, I sent
the weakest soldiers!

108
00:09:19,341 --> 00:09:21,013
Good, Opal.

109
00:09:35,821 --> 00:09:39,655
That's the florist! I recognize him!
What is he doing in this place?

110
00:09:40,661 --> 00:09:43,573
I injured my leg
and I can no longer walk.

111
00:09:43,621 --> 00:09:45,373
It's the fault of that cursed monster!

112
00:09:45,421 --> 00:09:47,332
Were you attacked by the monster?!

113
00:09:47,381 --> 00:09:49,258
No, I fell on the rocks.

114
00:09:49,301 --> 00:09:52,418
I came here to try
to avenge my son's death.

115
00:09:52,661 --> 00:09:54,731
Injured like that, you won't succeed.

116
00:09:54,781 --> 00:09:56,897
Don't worry, I will avenge you!

117
00:09:56,941 --> 00:09:59,819
Take this waterskin of water,
Highness! It will help you!

118
00:09:59,861 --> 00:10:02,011
- What should I do with it?
- Legend says...

119
00:10:02,061 --> 00:10:04,256
...that the monster of the first valley
must be confronted...

120
00:10:04,301 --> 00:10:06,212
.With water, not with the sword

121
00:10:12,821 --> 00:10:15,381
Damn, I suffer from vertigo!

122
00:10:20,141 --> 00:10:22,018
They are tongues of fire!

123
00:10:34,661 --> 00:10:36,219
What is it?

124
00:10:40,741 --> 00:10:44,336
Courage! Let's go!
Courage! Let's go!

125
00:10:52,141 --> 00:10:53,893
Damned monster!

126
00:11:18,861 --> 00:11:20,453
Take this!

127
00:11:23,541 --> 00:11:25,771
It didn't do anything to me!

128
00:11:46,461 --> 00:11:48,019
Take that!

129
00:11:50,221 --> 00:11:52,018
I can't hurt it!

130
00:11:59,621 --> 00:12:01,100
Damn it!

131
00:12:07,661 --> 00:12:10,494
Help! Let me go!

132
00:12:10,541 --> 00:12:12,611
Help!

133
00:12:14,301 --> 00:12:16,895
- Hey, look over there!
- He's already taken the Prince!

134
00:12:16,941 --> 00:12:18,090
Yes, he's got him!

135
00:12:18,461 --> 00:12:20,417
- He saw us!
- Let's run!

136
00:12:20,581 --> 00:12:23,414
Don't run away! Wait!

137
00:12:23,461 --> 00:12:26,419
Come back! Help me!

138
00:12:28,461 --> 00:12:33,012
It's so hot! Good
heavens, I'm burning!

139
00:12:33,061 --> 00:12:35,655
The monster of the first
valley must be faced...

140
00:12:35,701 --> 00:12:37,817
...with water, not
with the sword!

141
00:12:37,861 --> 00:12:41,092
Right, water! I'll
splash it with this!

142
00:12:51,261 --> 00:12:54,059
Incredible! The
water is killing it!

143
00:13:15,741 --> 00:13:17,891
Something came out of its mouth!

144
00:13:18,741 --> 00:13:21,653
The first day is about to
end. I only have two days...

145
00:13:21,701 --> 00:13:24,579
...before my mother dies
exhausted, poisoned by the venom.

146
00:13:24,901 --> 00:13:28,018
I must get past the other
two monsters. I must hurry!

147
00:13:29,021 --> 00:13:31,615
I'll take this with me.
It will give me light!

148
00:13:39,301 --> 00:13:42,179
Sapphire, dear!
Where are you, my little one?

149
00:13:42,221 --> 00:13:44,416
I would like to see you before I die.

150
00:13:44,461 --> 00:13:46,417
- Poor Queen!
- She will still live...

151
00:13:46,461 --> 00:13:48,656
..only two days!

152
00:14:05,021 --> 00:14:07,899
Poor Queen!
Who knows if Sapphire will make it...

153
00:14:10,541 --> 00:14:12,657
The temperature is dropping.

154
00:14:14,501 --> 00:14:17,618
But they are icicles!
I'm starting to feel cold.

155
00:14:20,141 --> 00:14:24,657
Thank goodness I have the fire, otherwise
I would risk freezing to death.

156
00:14:35,501 --> 00:14:39,096
I'm sleepy, but I must try
not to fall asleep.

157
00:14:39,141 --> 00:14:42,133
My time has never been
so precious!

158
00:14:50,021 --> 00:14:53,616
What is happening to me?
Why am I so sleepy?

159
00:15:00,821 --> 00:15:04,052
A day and a half has already passed!
If Sapphire doesn't return by tomorrow,

160
00:15:04,101 --> 00:15:07,650
- my dear wife will die!
- Sapphire will be killed by the monsters.

161
00:15:09,741 --> 00:15:12,050
Where could Sapphire be?
In the second valley?

162
00:15:14,461 --> 00:15:16,577
Do you know where the Three Valleys are?

163
00:15:17,221 --> 00:15:19,132
Will you take me there, dear friends?

164
00:15:19,781 --> 00:15:21,612
Hooray!

165
00:15:42,421 --> 00:15:45,174
I fell asleep
and it's past noon!

166
00:15:45,621 --> 00:15:47,612
It's the monster of the second valley!

167
00:15:57,421 --> 00:15:59,412
Take this! Go back!

168
00:16:28,741 --> 00:16:30,459
Sapphire!

169
00:16:47,341 --> 00:16:49,616
It's too tight!

170
00:16:50,461 --> 00:16:53,658
My sword!
Just a little more effort!

171
00:16:59,101 --> 00:17:01,456
Oh, no! I'm finished!

172
00:17:01,501 --> 00:17:03,298
I'm coming, Sapphire!

173
00:17:09,901 --> 00:17:12,096
- Choppy, give me the fire!
- Take it!

174
00:17:12,261 --> 00:17:14,013
Thanks, Choppy!

175
00:17:15,021 --> 00:17:16,613
Take this, monster!

176
00:17:40,221 --> 00:17:41,813
You managed to defeat it!

177
00:17:41,861 --> 00:17:43,897
But I still have to get past
the last monster,

178
00:17:43,941 --> 00:17:46,011
the one in the third valley.
Let's hurry!

179
00:17:46,221 --> 00:17:48,212
What do you say, great eagle?

180
00:17:48,821 --> 00:17:51,335
Take a little piece
of the monster's tail?

181
00:17:51,381 --> 00:17:53,656
Do you really think
it could be useful to us?

182
00:17:55,341 --> 00:17:56,820
Alright!

183
00:18:00,941 --> 00:18:03,819
Damn, it's so cold!
It's colder than ice!

184
00:18:04,101 --> 00:18:06,137
I'll put it in my sword's scabbard.

185
00:18:06,541 --> 00:18:08,213
Let's go, now!

186
00:18:10,341 --> 00:18:13,299
- Thank you, great eagle!
- Goodbye, friend!

187
00:18:13,341 --> 00:18:16,219
Goodbye! Goodbye!

188
00:18:16,261 --> 00:18:19,253
- Do you want to come with us?
- Yes! Yes! Yes!

189
00:18:19,501 --> 00:18:22,254
I wonder what
the monster of the third valley will be like.

190
00:19:09,901 --> 00:19:13,291
- Sapphire, did you see?
- They have no way out!

191
00:19:13,461 --> 00:19:17,170
- Do you see that grass over there?
- It must be the herb we are looking for!

192
00:19:17,261 --> 00:19:19,172
How will we reach it?

193
00:19:22,341 --> 00:19:24,172
Let's cross the swamp!

194
00:19:24,221 --> 00:19:26,689
- But it's terrifying!
- We have no choice

195
00:19:27,341 --> 00:19:29,901
Let's see how deep
this muddy water is.

196
00:19:39,141 --> 00:19:42,099
We have to get to the
grass! We can't stay here!

197
00:19:42,301 --> 00:19:45,498
The two of us could make it all
the way down there, don't you think?

198
00:19:45,901 --> 00:19:48,210
Would you two like to go
to get the grass?

199
00:19:48,261 --> 00:19:50,331
Do you feel up to
crossing the swamp?

200
00:19:50,381 --> 00:19:52,372
- Yes, yes, of course!
- Thank you, little birds!

201
00:20:25,061 --> 00:20:27,655
Watch out! These are the
monsters of the third valley!

202
00:20:29,541 --> 00:20:31,133
Terrifying!

203
00:20:33,301 --> 00:20:35,371
I must reach that grass!

204
00:20:39,021 --> 00:20:40,659
What?!

205
00:20:43,261 --> 00:20:45,013
The sword!

206
00:20:51,221 --> 00:20:53,815
- Come on, Choppy!
- Sapphire, help!

207
00:20:53,861 --> 00:20:56,500
Please save me, Sapphire! Help!

208
00:20:57,501 --> 00:20:59,412
Hang on, Choppy! I will save you!

209
00:20:59,461 --> 00:21:02,100
I can't do it! The water
is too cold for me!

210
00:21:02,421 --> 00:21:04,889
I will use the little piece of
the tail of the ice monster!

211
00:21:13,341 --> 00:21:15,013
They are freezing!

212
00:21:18,901 --> 00:21:20,573
They have frozen!

213
00:21:24,101 --> 00:21:26,331
Damn, how cold
this icy water is!

214
00:21:26,381 --> 00:21:28,417
I can't stop! Choppy!

215
00:21:28,461 --> 00:21:30,133
Here I am!

216
00:21:33,861 --> 00:21:36,500
We'd better skate!
We'll move faster!

217
00:21:43,021 --> 00:21:45,012
This will be enough!
Let's go back home!

218
00:21:45,061 --> 00:21:47,177
Good heavens,
today is the third day!

219
00:21:47,221 --> 00:21:50,019
We must be back at the
palace before the sun sets.

220
00:21:50,061 --> 00:21:51,813
Quick, let's run!

221
00:21:59,021 --> 00:22:01,012
We won't make it!

222
00:22:02,101 --> 00:22:04,410
We can ask the robins to
bring the herb to the castle!

223
00:22:04,461 --> 00:22:07,419
Right! Little friends, do you
feel up to flying to the castle?

224
00:22:07,461 --> 00:22:09,019
Yes! Yes!

225
00:22:13,861 --> 00:22:17,615
Here! Pour the herb juice
on the Queen's wound! Got it?

226
00:22:17,661 --> 00:22:19,014
Yes!

227
00:22:19,461 --> 00:22:23,010
Please! The life of my
mother depends on you!

228
00:22:39,461 --> 00:22:41,452
Sapphire will not return.

229
00:22:41,501 --> 00:22:44,811
Oh, Lord, please!
Let my wife be saved!

230
00:22:49,701 --> 00:22:52,135
Is there at least some hope?

231
00:23:06,701 --> 00:23:09,420
Why are you all standing
petrified staring at me?

232
00:23:10,901 --> 00:23:13,495
What?! You're alive?

233
00:23:13,741 --> 00:23:15,618
What did you say, Neelon?

234
00:23:17,021 --> 00:23:19,819
I was saying that he returned safe
and sound with the herb, that bastard...!

235
00:23:20,661 --> 00:23:22,458
Our dear Prince!

236
00:23:23,341 --> 00:23:27,016
He's not dead, damn him! I'm
going crazy! I'll never get rid of him!

237
00:23:27,061 --> 00:23:30,770
But I must succeed! I must
succeed! I must! I must!

238
00:23:32,581 --> 00:23:37,655
Did you see? He must have gone
crazy with joy over your recovery.

239
00:23:37,701 --> 00:23:41,057
- Hooray!
- Long live the Queen!

240
00:24:00,301 --> 00:24:03,020
- Did you make it in time?
- Yes, the Queen is safe!

241
00:24:03,861 --> 00:24:06,580
- What a relief!
- We made it, mom!

242
